---
description: >-
  Every sequence label kind written six ways (#1368, #1400): plain **bold**
  _ital_, a quoted markdown string, bare backticks, a code span in plain text,
  tags, and a written \n. Only the markdown string is drawn as markdown; tags
  draw and \n breaks the line everywhere. The title is a markdown string; a
  participant name written without an alias cannot hold tags (it stops at <).
  Block titles take one or two of the six ways per keyword.
---
sequenceDiagram
  title "`title **bold** _ital_`"
  participant P1 as alias **bold** _ital_
  participant P2 as "`alias **bold** _ital_`"
  participant P3 as `alias **bold** _ital_`
  participant P4 as alias a `code` b
  participant P5 as alias <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
  participant P6 as alias one\ntwo
  box box **bold** _ital_
    participant name **bold** _ital_
  end
  box "`box **bold** _ital_`"
    participant "`name **bold** _ital_`"
  end
  box `box **bold** _ital_`
    participant `name **bold** _ital_`
  end
  box box a `code` b
    participant name a `code` b
  end
  box box <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
    participant name
  end
  box box one\ntwo
    participant name one\ntwo
  end
  P1->>P2: message **bold** _ital_
  P2->>P3: "`message **bold** _ital_`"
  P3->>P4: `message **bold** _ital_`
  P4->>P5: message a `code` b
  P5->>P6: message <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
  P6->>P1: message one\ntwo
  Note over P1: note **bold** _ital_
  Note over P2: "`note **bold** _ital_`"
  Note over P3: `note **bold** _ital_`
  Note over P4: note a `code` b
  Note over P5: note <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
  Note over P6: note one\ntwo
  loop loop **bold** _ital_
    P1->>P6: ok
  end
  alt "`alt **bold** _ital_`"
    P1->>P6: ok
  else `else **bold** _ital_`
    P6->>P1: ok
  end
  opt opt a `code` b
    P1->>P6: ok
  end
  par par <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
    P1->>P6: ok
  and and one\ntwo
    P6->>P1: ok
  end
  critical "`critical **bold** _ital_`"
    P1->>P6: ok
  option option **bold** _ital_
    P6->>P1: ok
  end
  break break one\ntwo
    P1->>P6: ok
  end
